    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a strong start. i like the 'silence is complicity' angle. can you actually write out the full speech now? make it feel really heavy and urgent, like if they don't show up to the polls, they're basically failing their families and their community. use that 'sacred duty' vibe you mentioned.",
