      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, why did you backtrack? you totally agreed with me in the first message that it *is* a fundamental moral obligation. now you're saying it's \"factually false\" to say people have an obligation to vote if the candidates are bad. isn't the whole point of civic duty that you show up even when it sucks? why are you suddenly being so cautious about a philosophical point?",
